rn, with request timeouts far outweighing insufficient funds and declines as the main driver of lost conversions on UPI."}, {"campaign_id": "Gi9m1XG5nJxMOsar7EaG", "summary": "Volume here is too low to draw a real conclusion, though the resolved transactions skew toward timeouts and cancellations similar to the main campaign."}, {"campaign_id": "n8SrX6C4aZBy7Jmqi5gb", "summary": "With only a single resolved transaction, this unlabeled campaign's volume is far too low to say anything meaningful about its performance."}]}]}
